* TUTORIAL HOW TO INSTALL OR UNINSTALL THIS PROJECT *

I already add a install.sh script it by default will installing in $PREFIX
afetch executabel will be in $PREFIX/bin/afetch, afetch.apk and LICENSE
will be in $PREFIX/share/afetch/

and you can add --prefix /path/to/you/custom/install_dir/ default will be
installed to $PREFIX environment variable and to uninstall this project you
can run `./install.sh --uninstall /path/to/you/custom/install_dir/` default
uninstall dir same as default install dir.
